art_index":53,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a0-db0e-11ef-9428-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高麗","place_name_jianti_auto":"高丽","resolved_place_entity_id":226,"start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a1-db0e-11ef-ab06-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靺鞨","place_name_jianti_auto":"靺鞨","place_note":"黑龙江下游","resolved_place_entity_id":1012,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a2-db0e-11ef-952b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靺鞨","place_name_jianti_auto":"靺鞨","place_note":"黑龙江下游","resolved_place_entity_id":1012,"start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a6-db0e-11ef-87f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"罗唐战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0978"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、朝鲜（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又咸亨五年，刘仁轨东伐新罗，率兵绝瓠卢河，攻其大镇七重城...","context_before":"...卢河[在庆州西界。《志》云：在高丽南界，新罗七重城之北。","source_end_index":55,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6257337e-5ff7-5c51-b75f-071e5977f9de","source_start_index":29,"source_text":"唐咸亨四年，李谨行破高丽叛者于瓠卢河之西，即此水也。"},{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...北。唐咸亨四年，李谨行破高丽叛者于瓠卢河之西，即此水也。","source_end_index":86,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6257337e-5ff7-5c51-b75f-071e5977f9de","source_start_index":55,"source_text":"又咸亨五年，刘仁轨东伐新罗，率兵绝瓠卢河，攻其大镇七重城，破之"},{"context_after":"或曰：城在营州境内，恐误]。","context_before":"...渌栅，追奔二百余里，拔辱夷城，遂进围平壤，高丽平。是也。","source_end_index":111,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a33da905-7eee-5b7d-8132-68b9c8f6692a","source_start_index":52,"source_text":"又伐奴城，亦在平壤西北，唐咸亨二年，行军总管李谨行破高丽叛者于瓠芦河西，其妻刘氏留伐奴城，高丽引靺鞨来攻，刘氏拒却之。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/九、朝鲜（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"4閏五月，燕山道總管、右領軍大將軍李謹行大破高麗叛者於瓠蘆河之西，俘獲數千人，餘衆皆奔新羅。時謹行妻劉氏留伐奴城，高麗引靺鞨攻之，劉氏擐甲帥衆守城，久之，虜退。上嘉其功，封燕國夫人。謹行，靺鞨人突地稽之子也，武力絕人，爲衆夷所憚。","content_fanyi":"闰五月，燕山道总管、右领军大将军李谨行在瓠芦河以西大败反叛的高丽人，俘获数千人，其余部众都逃奔新罗。当时李谨行的妻子刘氏留在伐奴城，高丽引领靺鞨人前来攻城，刘氏披甲率领众人守城，坚持很久后，敌人退走。唐高宗嘉奖她的功劳，封她为燕国夫人。李谨行是靺鞨人突地稽的儿子，武力超绝常人，众夷人都很畏惧他。","content_jianti_auto":"4闰五月，燕山道总管、右领军大将军李谨行大破高丽叛者于瓠芦河之西，俘获数千人，余众皆奔新罗。时谨行妻刘氏留伐奴城，高丽引靺鞨攻之，刘氏擐甲帅众守城，久之，虏退。上嘉其功，封燕国夫人。谨行，靺鞨人突地稽之子也，武力绝人，为众夷所惮。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19850,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b9c71789-db0e-11ef-ae4f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b9c717aa-db0e-11ef-a272-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b9c717ab-db0e-11ef-b66b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b9c717ac-db0e-11ef-a1a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「月」下有「辛巳」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「月」下有「辛巳」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a9-db0e-11ef-b920-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a8-db0e-11ef-bc6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"婺州","place_name_jianti_auto":"婺州","place_note":"浙江省金华市","resolved_place_entity_id":1183,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9c717ae-db0e-11ef-8e23-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5秋，七月，婺州大水，溺死者五千人。","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月，婺州发生大水灾，溺死的有五千人。","content_jianti_auto":"5秋，七月，婺州大水，溺死者五千人。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19851,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b9c717a7-db0e-11ef-b741-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"储君","official_name":"太子","official_note":"太子是皇位继承人，在唐代通常指皇帝的儿子被立为储君。在此上下文中，由于高宗皇帝患病，太子被命令在延福殿处理各司的启事，这体现了太子在皇帝无法理政时代行部分职责，属于临时摄政或辅助理政的角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"令太子於延福殿受諸司啓事","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"50710e30-df1c-4fea-bd14-4588f0b594eb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"延福殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"延福殿","resolved_place_entity_id":4615,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b9c717b1-db0e-11ef-85a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"6八月，辛丑，上以瘧疾，令太子於延福殿受諸司啓事。","content_fanyi":"八月十九日辛丑，唐高宗因身患疟疾，下令让太子在延福殿受理各官署奏报的政事。","content_jianti_auto":"6八月，辛丑，上以疟疾，令太子于延福殿受诸司启事。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19852,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b9c717af-db0e-11ef-bca4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"中書令","official_note":"中書令是唐代中書省的長官，負責草擬詔令，為宰相之一，在《資治通鑑》中常出現於官員任免或逝世記錄中。此處表示閻立本擔任此職並去世。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"中書令閻立本薨","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"d78902ac-d8e7-4abf-9d0f-dda5b294e6f7"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"閻立本","people_name_jianti_auto":"阎立本","people_xingming":"阎立本","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b9c717b3-db0e-11ef-8298-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":